# Transient eval run artifacts — not source
*.json
*.md
*.log
*.out
*.err
*.png
*.py
*.localbak

!.gitignore

# Curated proof-of-concept trajectories (keep in git)
!proof/
!proof/**

# Scratch dumps under proof/ (persona extractions, etc.) — not curated
proof/*.txt
proof/persona_*

# Longitudinal eval history — the ONE durable artifact here. Append-only, one compact
# record per run. Tracked in git on purpose: "are we getting better?" is unanswerable if
# the baseline is wiped every time the transient run_*.json files are cleaned up.
!history.jsonl
